            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
  <li><strong>Automatic updates are live.</strong> Lanki checks for new versions once a day and installs them in place — no more downloading the app by hand.</li>
  <li>Select text anywhere, press ⌘⇧A, and get pronunciation, translation, definition and examples — plus one-click Add to Anki.</li>
  <li>Install via Homebrew: <code>brew tap rGradov/lanki &amp;&amp; brew install --cask lanki</code>.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
